  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.36: Reduce historical PR discovery requests with bounded GraphQL batches and private reuse of complete unchanged head/base/count metadata. Preserve earlier author-date work across later merges/rebases, repository restrictions, and complete-evidence fallbacks. Add request-plan/cache/pending counts, sanitized request context, separate cumulative and wall timings, correct deadline phases, and scope-aware guidance. Verify native retained-chain/squash reconciliation and offline engineering parity. Estimator priors and rates remain unchanged. EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated; declared rewrite events and workday allocation do not recover missing history or actual labor. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.36/CHANGELOG.md",
